## How I Approach GRC

1. Understand the business process, system, and applicable requirements.
2. Identify risks and map them to relevant controls.
3. Evaluate control design and available evidence.
4. Document findings, business impact, and remediation priorities.
5. Assign accountable owners and track corrective actions.
6. Verify closure evidence and communicate residual risk.

